{'slug': 'remote-chief-engineer-spacecraft-terran-orbital-corporation-1128167', 'id': '1128167', 'epoch': 1759219241, 'date': '2025-09-30T08:00:41+00:00', 'company': 'Terran Orbital Corporation', 'company_logo': '', 'position': 'Chief Engineer Spacecraft', 'tags': ['system', 'technical', 'support', 'growth', 'engineer', 'engineering'], 'description': "Join a team where your impact reaches beyond the stars! At Terran Orbital, youâ\x80\x99re not just part of the system â\x80\x93 youâ\x80\x99re a vital force propelling our mission forward. As trailblazers in satellite manufacturing and aerospace innovation, we shatter boundaries daily to deliver groundbreaking solutions that power our nationâ\x80\x99s defense and commercial missions. We are a unique, fast growing, and trusted team dedicated to swiftly and efficiently designing, building, launching, and operating state of the art satellites for advanced mission constellations. If youâ\x80\x99re driven by purpose, inspired by challenges, and ready to leave your mark on the universe, youâ\x80\x99ll find a home and endless opportunities for growth here. Together, letâ\x80\x99s redefine what is possible in orbit and beyond!

Summary
Terran Orbital is seeking an experienced Chief Engineer - Spacecraft to join our growing team as a key leadership team member. Reporting to the VP, Space & Mission Systems, the Chief Engineer - Spacecraft will be a key member of the engineering leadership team that works closely with functional engineering teams and program managers as a technical authority to ensure product integrity that meets customersâ\x80\x99 needs with technical excellence. The Chief Engineer will also support the development of solutions, provide input to technical cost proposals, drive affordability, and ensure the technical integrity of delivered products with rigor through design, testing, and technical issue resolution. This role will serve as a technical authority for the organization and provide technical leadership for the development roadmaps, engineering standards, process, and tool development, incorporating best practices and lessons learned across the port.<br/><br/>Please mention the word **FASHIONABLE** and tag RMjAuNTUuMjE0LjExNg== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjAuNTUuMjE0LjExNg==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.", 'location': 'Irvine, CA', 'salary_min': 100000, 'salary_max': 150000, 'apply_url': 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-chief-engineer-spacecraft-terran-orbital-corporation-1128167', 'logo': '', 'url': 'https://remoteOK.com/remote-jobs/remote-chief-engineer-spacecraft-terran-orbital-corporation-1128167'}
